            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "This is awesome feedback! I will absolutely take a look. Thank you @echasnovski and @pkazmier \n\nMy picker is currently Fzf-lua and I haven't thought to look their. I would open a pull request but I am in the middle of finishing up a summer semester.\n\nI have a feeling that mini.clue can also already support the `z=` command, I think the feature that `which-key` adds is that it provides a one character press to accept a spelling suggestion, and it is probably my ignorance of how `mini.clue` works. I will also tinker when I can to see if I can get something working.",
